Package: oocurl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Capability-bounded HTTP and API client with syntax-highlighted responses
 A capability-bounded HTTP and API client written in pure openOODA, featuring
 status code classification, header inspection, syntax-highlighted response
 payloads via oote palettes, safe file writes, and an MCP stdio surface.
